stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    state "AI USE CASE" as USECASE
    state "CAPTURE" as CAP
    state "OBSERVE" as OBS
    state "ORIENT" as ORI
    state "DO" as DO
    state "ACT" as ACT
    state "SHIP" as SHIP

    note right of CAP
        video → ffmpeg → keyframes
    end note

    note right of OBS
        /workshop-observe
        Analyze screenshots
        Extract user flows
        Write observations to RAC
    end note

    note right of ORI
        /workshop-orient
        RAC requirements
        Architecture decisions
        Workshop design
        decided validate
    end note

    note right of DO
        /workshop-do
        Scaffold showroom content
        Scaffold automation infra
        make build · helm lint
        GitHub Pages deploy
    end note

    note right of ACT
        /workshop-act
        ArgoCD sync to prelude
        Playwright browser tests
        Fix-and-test loop
        Acceptance report
    end note

    USECASE --> CAP
    CAP --> OBS

    OBS --> ORI : plan
    ORI --> DO : scaffold
    DO --> ACT : deploy & test

    ACT --> SHIP : all green ✅
    ACT --> OBS : gaps found 🔄
    ACT --> ORI : scope change 🔄
    ACT --> DO : content fix 🔄

    classDef capture fill:#ffb347,stroke:#e67e22,color:#000,font-weight:bold
    classDef observe fill:#87ceeb,stroke:#2980b9,color:#000,font-weight:bold
    classDef orient fill:#dda0dd,stroke:#8e44ad,color:#000,font-weight:bold
    classDef do fill:#98d8c8,stroke:#27ae60,color:#000,font-weight:bold
    classDef act fill:#f7dc6f,stroke:#f39c12,color:#000,font-weight:bold
    classDef ship fill:#2ecc71,stroke:#1a9c4a,color:#fff,font-weight:bold

    classDef usecase fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#c0392b,color:#fff,font-weight:bold
    class USECASE usecase
    class CAP capture
    class OBS observe
    class ORI orient
    class DO do
    class ACT act
    class SHIP ship
